### Versioned endpoint: get all assets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Versioned endpoint: paged assets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### API quality: invalid page should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/paged?page=-1&size=5&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### API quality: invalid size should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/paged?page=0&size=100&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### API quality: invalid sort field should return 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=password&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Report: assets grouped by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/assets-by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Report: assets grouped by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/assets-by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Report: assets grouped by location
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/assets-by-location
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
